# Per-element callee with an unordered/conflict-group output — refused

Only an ordered plain-rung chain with a total base lowers to a closed
IfThenElse body. `KamerConflict`'s output is a root-level unordered group of two
OVERLAPPING conditions with no unconditional base — a conflict-bearing group, no
single closed body. Refused per element (besluit 1-A weiger-grens).

```catala
declaration scope KamerConflict:
  input grondslag content integer
  output bedrag content integer

scope KamerConflict:
  definition bedrag under condition grondslag > 0 consequence equals grondslag + 1
  definition bedrag under condition grondslag > 5 consequence equals grondslag + 2

declaration scope Aanslag:
  input grondslagen content list of integer
  output totaal content integer

scope Aanslag:
  definition totaal equals
    combine all b
      among (map each g among grondslagen to (output of KamerConflict with { -- grondslag: g }).bedrag)
      in acc initially 0 with (acc + b)
```
